        "descriptions": [
            {
                "value": "The dataset contains input data for the life cycle assessment of potential scenarios for the in situ manufacturing of an unstabilized rammed earth wall, used to determine their environmental impacts. The analysis aims to assess and compare the environmental impacts of manual and robotic processes and to support the methodological foundation of the associated scientific publication.",
                "descriptionType": "Abstract",
                "lang": "en"
            }
